# TOTALITY: what a new unit plays, by itself. It brings its whole sound (two of them, A and B, kept), VOX
# sings (HALO, now and then), and it travels on every 16 bars: scene after scene, its sound gliding between
# A and B as each scene says, with nothing written to the flash for any of it (it moves all night). The
# hands still travel it (PRESET), and SCENE's TRAVELS sets it back to by hand. Audio in totality.wav.
fresh 6
wav totality.wav
wait 1000
expect journey 7
expect nscenes 6
expect playing 1
expect scene 1
expect jtravel 2
expect vsing3 2
expect ab_have 3
expect ab_t 0
shot totality_1.png
wait 45000
expect travelling 1
shot totality_travel.png
wait 14000
expect scene 2
expect travelling 0
expect ab_t 43
expect vox_notes >0
wait 56000
expect scene 3
expect ab_t 92
shot totality_3.png
wait 56000
expect scene 4
expect ab_t 127
expect vcur 3
expect store_writes 0
expect clips 0
turn PRESET -1
wait 13000
expect scene 3
expect ab_t 92
tap EDIT
turn SELECT 14
wait 100
turn K2 -3
wait 100
expect jtravel 0
tap HOME
wait 120000
expect scene 3
expect travelling 0
wavstop
expect clips 0
expect guardcount 0
